{"id":"cb3f50bafebb1dd5","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-rule-admissibility.md","title":"有限推理族的可采纳性","display":"df-rule-admissibility — 有限推理族的可采纳性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-rule-admissibility","aliases":["72-df-rule-admissibility"],"display":"df-rule-admissibility — 有限推理族的可采纳性","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4, print36–46/PDF48–58; local abstract formulation of admissibility","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-rule-admissibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-rule-admissibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rule-admissibility — 有限推理族的可采纳性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4, print36–46/PDF48–58; local abstract formulation of admissibility"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 是本册带标签演算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\mathsf{Tag}\\times W\\times Q^n\\times Q)\">\\(\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\mathsf{Tag}\\times W\\times Q^n\\times Q)\\)</span> 为有限元数规则实例族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tag},W\">\\(\\mathsf{Tag},W\\)</span> 为给定集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\vdash q\">\\(\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\)</span> 使用有限证明树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(D_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD_{\\mathcal C}&amp;:=\\{q\\in Q:\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adm}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal U)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U\\ (\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\subseteq D_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow q\\in D_{\\mathcal C}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD_{\\mathcal C}&amp;:=\\{q\\in Q:\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adm}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal U)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U\\ (\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\subseteq D_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow q\\in D_{\\mathcal C}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可采纳性只要求规则把可证前提送到可证结论，不预设统一的短证明变换，也不等同于规则已经列在演算内。零前提规则要求结论本来可证。有限前提范围将在扩充不增加定理的证明中实际使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\mathsf{Tag}\\times W\\times Q^n\\times Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tag},W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\vdash q","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD_{\\mathcal C}&:=\\{q\\in Q:\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adm}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal U)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U\\ (\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\subseteq D_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow q\\in D_{\\mathcal C}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1651,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"i